# ImStudium agent rules

- Read [AGENTS.md](../AGENTS.md) and [docs/STUDIUM.md](../docs/STUDIUM.md) before changing behavior.
- All CLI `--json` output must include `schemaVersion: "1"`.
- Errors use `ImstudiumError` with `code`, `message`, `hint`.
- SDK has no Commander imports; CLI has no raw fetch — use `@imstudium/sdk`.
- MCP tools are defined in `packages/mcp/src/tools.ts`.
- Extraction is **one pipeline**: `packages/sdk/src/ingest/local-docs.ts` (pdf-inspector for PDF, AnyDoc for everything else). No Tesseract, poppler, LibreOffice, unzip, or cloud parse.
- Run `bun run validate` before proposing ship.
- Do not ship a custom search engine — build `search/corpus.jsonl` indexes; agents grep/semantic-search natively (see `agentSearchGuidance`).
- Exam dates from achievement text are `confirmed: false` — preserve that semantics.
- Formulas/diagrams: open the original in `files/`. `content.md` is not LaTeX.
- `viewer.html` is generated on read/view only — not during bulk extract.
